#. 【変な事】
msgctxt "0001 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "[something really weird]"
msgstr ""

#. へ、変な事って…？
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Something...weird?"
msgstr ""

#. さっき…部屋で横になってたら……
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Just a little while ago, I was laying down in my\n"
"room..."
msgstr ""

#. 急に…部屋のドアが、
#. ガタガタと揺れ出して…
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"And all of a sudden, my door started rattling and\n"
"shaking."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それは、肺から空気を絞り出したような声で…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Her voice sounded like all the air had been squeezed\n"
"out of her lungs.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>聞いていたボクも、思わず緊張した。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Just hearing her talk made me tense up.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 誰かが無理矢理…
#. ドアを開けようとしているみたいでした。
msgctxt "0007 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "It was like someone was trying to force the door open."
msgstr ""

#. 鍵を掛けておいたんで、
#. 開きはしなかったんですけど…
msgctxt "0008 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"My door was locked, so they couldn't get in, of\n"
"course."
msgstr ""

#. でも、その揺れは…どんどん酷くなって…
msgctxt "0009 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "But they started shaking the door harder and harder."
msgstr ""

#. 私は怖くて、そのままじっとしていたんですけど…
msgctxt "0010 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "I was so scared I couldn't even move."
msgstr ""

#. そ、それで、どうしたの！？
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "S-So what happened!?"
msgstr ""

#. …しばらくしたら収まりました。
msgctxt "0012 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "After a while, it just...stopped."
msgstr ""

#. 後で、恐る恐るドアを開けて、
#. 確認してみたんですけど…
msgctxt "0013 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"I let some time go by, then I got up and opened the\n"
"door to check outside..."
msgstr ""

#. …誰もいませんでした。
msgctxt "0014 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "But there was nobody there."
msgstr ""

#. 誰かが…ドアを無理矢理開けようと…？
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Someone tried to force their way into your room...?"
msgstr ""

#. でも…誰がそんな事を？
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But...who would do something like that?"
msgstr ""

#. みんなを疑うって訳じゃないんですけど…
#. でも…ちょっと心配で……
msgctxt "0017 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"It's not like I'm suspicious of anyone here, but\n"
"still...it makes me nervous."
msgstr ""

#. もし、夜時間の間に、
#. あんな事があったらどうしようって…
msgctxt "0018 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"What if something like that happened in the middle of\n"
"the night? What would I do then...?"
msgstr ""

#. だ、大丈夫だよ…
#. 夜時間は外出を禁止してるんだし…
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Y-You don't have to worry about that, right? I mean,\n"
"we can't go outside during nighttime."
msgstr ""

#. でも、ただの口約束ですよね？
#. もし約束を破る人がいたら…
msgctxt "0020 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"But that's just a promise we made, right? If someone\n"
"decided to break that promise..."
msgstr ""

#. じゃ、じゃあさ…
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Th-Then..."
msgstr ""

#. 今晩は、ボクの部屋に泊まれば？
#. そうすれば怖くないでしょ？
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Why don't you stay in my room tonight? Would that make\n"
"you feel a little better?"
msgstr ""

#. え…！？
msgctxt "0023 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr ""

#. 校則では、<CLT 3>『就寝は個室で』<CLT>としか
#. 書かれてなかったよね？
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"All it said in the school regulations was that we had\n"
"to sleep in \"<CLT 3>the dorm rooms<CLT>\", right?"
msgstr ""

#. 誰がどの個室で寝ろとまでは、
#. 書いてなかった訳だし…
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"It didn't state specifically *which* room each person\n"
"had to sleep in. So..."
msgstr ""

#. で、でも…１つの部屋に２人きりっていうのは…
msgctxt "0026 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "B-But...two people sharing one room is...you know..."
msgstr ""

#. あ…！
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...Ah!"
msgstr ""

#. ご、ごめんッ！　気付かなかった！！
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Oh jeez, I'm sorry! I didn't even think about that!"
msgstr ""

#. ホ、ホントだよ！　気付かなかっただけなんだ！！
#. 決して、やましい気持ちとか、そういうのは…
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Honestly, that didn't even cross my mind!"
msgstr ""

#. いえ…私も…
#. 嫌とかそういう訳じゃないんですけど…
msgctxt "0030 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"No, I know, me either. It's not even that I mind the\n"
"idea, but..."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0031 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. あの、もしよかったら、
#. 一晩だけ部屋を交換してもらえませんか？
msgctxt "0032 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"Um, if you don't mind, could we maybe switch rooms?\n"
"Just for tonight?"
msgstr ""

#. 部屋の…交換…？
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Switch rooms...?"
msgstr ""

#. そ、それで…舞園さんが安心するなら、
#. ボクは構わないけど…
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I-If it'll help put your mind at ease, then it's\n"
"totally fine with me."
msgstr ""

#. でも…舞園さんがボクの部屋に入るのは
#. ともかく…
msgctxt "0035 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But... I don't mind you staying in my room, but..."
msgstr ""

#. ボクが、舞園さんの部屋に入ったりして、
#. 大丈夫なの？
msgctxt "0036 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...are you sure you're okay with me staying in yours?"
msgstr ""

#. その…色々と問題があるんじゃないかと…
msgctxt "0037 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "That doesn't, like...concern you?"
msgstr ""

#. それは大丈夫です。
#. 苗木君の事、信用していますから…
msgctxt "0038 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "It's fine. I trust you..."
msgstr ""

#. そ、それならいいんだけど…
msgctxt "0039 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "In that case, then..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>「キーン、コーン…　カーン、コーン」
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0040 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>*Ding dong, bing bong*\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. えー、校内放送でーす。
#. 午後１０時になりました。
msgctxt "0041 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Mm, ahem, this is a school announcement. It is now 10\n"
"p.m."
msgstr ""

#. ただいまより<CLT 3>“夜時間”<CLT>になります。
msgctxt "0042 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "As such, it is officially <CLT 3>nighttime<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 間もなく食堂はドアをロックされますので、
#. 立ち入り禁止となりま～す。
msgctxt "0043 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Soon the doors to the dining hall will be locked, and\n"
"entry at that point is strictly prohibited."
msgstr ""

#. ではでは、いい夢を。おやすみなさい…
msgctxt "0044 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Okay then...sweet dreams, everyone! Good night, sleep\n"
"tight, don't let the bed bugs bite..."
msgstr ""

#. 大変…夜時間になっちゃいましたね。
msgctxt "0045 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "Oh man, it's already nighttime..."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、部屋を交換するって事でいいね…
#. ボクは舞園さんの部屋に行くから…
msgctxt "0046 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Okay, so it's settled. I'll head to your room right\n"
"now."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…っと、部屋の交換をするなら、
#. お互いの鍵も交換しておかないと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0047 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Oh, if we're gonna trade rooms, we'd better trade\n"
"keys, too.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …そうですね。お互いの鍵を交換しておきましょう。
msgctxt "0048 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "Ah, that's right. We'll have to trade keys."
msgstr ""

#. ま…また！？
msgctxt "0049 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Again!?"
msgstr ""

#. エスパーですから。
msgctxt "0050 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "Like I said, I'm psychic."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0051 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. …あれ？　冗談です…ってのはないの？
msgctxt "0052 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"...Huh? Hey, aren't you gonna say you were just\n"
"kidding?"
msgstr ""

#. 冗談じゃ…なかったりして。
msgctxt "0053 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "What if I *wasn't* just kidding...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>舞園さんの顔には…
#. 笑顔らしきものが戻っていた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0054 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Something resembling a smile had made its way to her\n"
"face.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>よかった…
#. 少しは落ち着いたみたいだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0055 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Thank goodness. It looks like she's already started to\n"
"get back to normal.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ…鍵の交換をしよっか。
msgctxt "0056 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Okay, we'd better trade keys, then."
msgstr ""

#. はい、そうですね。
msgctxt "0057 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "Yup, let's do it."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>互いの鍵を交換し合い、
#. ボクが再び舞園さんの顔に視線を戻すと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0058 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>We exchanged keys, and when I looked back up at her\n"
"again...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>今度は…心配そうな表情があった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0059 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...there was another worried expression there.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …苗木君、気を付けてくださいね。
#. 万が一、誰か来ても絶対にドアを開けちゃ駄目ですよ。
msgctxt "0060 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"Makoto...please be careful. If someone comes to the\n"
"door, don't open it no matter what."
msgstr ""

#. うん、わかってる。
msgctxt "0061 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I won't."
msgstr ""

#. 舞園さんも…
#. 誰か来ても絶対にドアを開けちゃ駄目だよ。
msgctxt "0062 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"The same goes for you, Sayaka. No matter who it is,\n"
"don't open your door for anyone."
msgstr ""

#. 苗木君だとわかっても絶対に開けませんよ。
#. でないと、部屋を交換した意味がありませんもんね。
msgctxt "0063 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"Even if I'm sure it's you, I absolutely won't open it.\n"
"Otherwise, what's the point of even switching?"
msgstr ""

#. あ、そうだ！　念の為に言っておくけど、
#. ボクの部屋のシャワールームって建付けが悪いんだよ。
msgctxt "0064 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Oh, by the way... Just so you know, my bathroom door\n"
"tends to get stuck."
msgstr ""

#. だから、シャワールームのドアを開ける場合は…
msgctxt "0065 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "There's a little trick to opening it..."
msgstr ""

#. ドアノブをひねりつつ、
#. 上に持ち上げるようにしてドアを押し開けて。
msgctxt "0066 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"You have to turn the knob, then lift up on the door\n"
"while you pull it out."
msgstr ""

#. そうすれば、簡単に開くからさ。
msgctxt "0067 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Just do that and the door should open no problem."
msgstr ""

#. でも、夜時間は、
#. シャワーの水って出ませんでしたよね？
msgctxt "0068 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"Okay, but the showers don't work during nighttime\n"
"anyway, right?"
msgstr ""

#. あ、そっか…忘れてた。
msgctxt "0069 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Oh, that's right. I totally forgot..."
msgstr ""

#. だけど、朝起きた後で使わせてもらうかもしれません。
#. …ありがとうございます。
msgctxt "0070 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"But I guess I might use it when I get up in the\n"
"morning. So thank you."
msgstr ""

#. …じゃあ、ボクはそろそろ行くね。
msgctxt "0071 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Okay, well, I'd better get going."
msgstr ""

#. 舞園さん…また明日…
msgctxt "0072 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "See you tomorrow, Sayaka."
msgstr ""

#. あ、さっきの話ですけど…
msgctxt "0073 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "Oh, and about what I said before..."
msgstr ""

#. ん…？
msgctxt "0074 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Hm?"
msgstr ""

#. エスパーって言うのは冗談です。
#. ホントは、ただの勘なんです。
msgctxt "0075 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"When I said I was psychic, it really was a joke.\n"
"Honestly, I'm just very perceptive."
msgstr ""

#. うん、わかってるよ…
msgctxt "0076 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Yeah, I know."
msgstr ""

#. …おやすみなさい。
msgctxt "0077 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "...Good night, then."
msgstr ""

#. また、明日……
msgctxt "0078 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "See you in the morning."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>舞園さんの笑顔に見送られながら、
#. ボクは自分の部屋を後にした。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0079 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Sayaka gave me one last parting smile, and I headed\n"
"off to \"my\" room.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>まったく…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0080 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Jeez...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんだってんだよ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0081 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Seriously, what's going on here?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>問題だらけだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0082 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's just so many problems.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>何が…一番問題なんだ？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0083 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I can't even decide what the biggest problem is...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここから出られない事…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0084 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That we're trapped in here?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>さっき見せられたあの映像…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0085 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That what I saw in that video might be real?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モノクマ…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0086 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Monokuma?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>黒幕の目的…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0087 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What the mastermind has in store for us?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それとも…ボク達自身…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0088 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Or...are *we* our biggest problem?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>………………
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0089 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここから出たい…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0090 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I want to get out of here.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>殺せる訳がない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0091 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But I could never kill someone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなも…そうなのか…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0092 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Do the others all feel the same?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>………………
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0093 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それが…１番の問題か……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0094 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Yeah, that's definitely the biggest problem right now.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>………………
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0095 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>………………
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0096 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>………………
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0097 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>「ピンポーン…」<CLT>
msgctxt "0098 | NARRATION"
msgid "<CLT 23>*Ding dong*<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…ん？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0099 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Huh?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>目を開けたボクは、
#. まず最初に部屋の時計を見上げた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0100 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>When I opened my eyes, they darted immediately to the\n"
"clock.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. １０時近く…
#. いつの間にか…寝てたのか……
msgctxt "0101 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"It's almost 10 o'clock. I fell asleep without even\n"
"realizing it..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もうすぐ夜時間…
#. それなのに…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0102 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Nighttime's about to start...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …誰か来た？
msgctxt "0103 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...so how come someone's here?"
msgstr ""

#. ま、舞園さん…
#. こんな時間にどうしたの…？
msgctxt "0104 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Sayaka? What are you doing out so late?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>と、そこでボクは気が付いた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0105 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That's when I noticed...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>彼女の体が…小刻みに震えている事に。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0106 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Her body was trembling.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 何か…あったの…？
msgctxt "0107 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I-Is everything okay...?"
msgstr ""

#. ごめんなさい…
#. ちょっと<CLT 1>【変な事】<CLT>があって…
msgctxt "0108 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"Sorry to bother you, but...<CLT 1>[something really weird]<CLT>\n"
"just happened."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. 今は校章が浮かんでいるだけか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0109 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on.\n"
"Right now, it's just showing the school crest.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、またいつモノクマが出てくるかと思うと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0110 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't even wanna think about when he might show up\n"
"on that thing next...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はあ……
msgctxt "0111 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Urgh..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんなカメラで見られてると思うと…
#. まったく最悪の気分だ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0112 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I hate knowing someone could be watching me...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>校則によると、監視カメラを壊したらマズイんだよな。
#. ムカツクけど、放っておくしかない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0113 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>We're not allowed to mess with the cameras, so I'd\n"
"better make sure I don't touch it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ごめんなさい、こんな夜遅くに…
msgctxt "0114 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "I'm really sorry to come by so late..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…舞園さん！？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0115 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Sayaka!?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いや、舞園さんを放って、
#. 出て行く訳にはいかない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0116 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>No, I can't just leave and ignore Sayaka...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>このドアは、建付けが悪いんだったな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0117 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This door doesn't quite fit in the doorframe.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 開け方のコツ、忘れないようにしないと。
msgctxt "0118 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I'll have to make sure and remember the trick to\n"
"opening it."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>鉄板のような物が打ち付けられている。
#. ボクは閉じ込められてるのか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0119 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's some kind of metal plate mounted here. Am I\n"
"really trapped in here...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>鉄板のような物が打ち付けられている。
#. ボクは閉じ込められてるのか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0120 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's some kind of metal plate mounted here. Am I\n"
"really trapped in here...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>紙は、はがしたけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0121 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I tore the paper off the wall, but...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あの内容を思い出すだけでも、
#. 嫌な気分になる…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0122 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...just remembering what it said still makes me feel\n"
"queasy.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>メモ帳がある。
#. 今、使う必要はなさそうだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0123 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't need to write anything down right now.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>たまには掃除くらいしようかな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0124 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Maybe I should tidy up a bit...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これは…工具セットだな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0125 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's...a toolkit.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ビニールの包装がされてる。
#. まだ新品の未開封品みたいだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0126 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It must be brand-new. It's still in the shrink-wrap.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>まぁ、工具セットなんて使う事はないだろうな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0127 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Well, I don't think I need it right now.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ちょっと触っただけで、
#. 手に金箔が付く模擬刀…<CLT>
msgctxt "0128 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The gold coating on this replica sword comes off at\n"
"the slightest touch.<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…気を付けないとな。<CLT>
msgctxt "0129 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "<CLT 4>I'd better be careful...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ちょっと触っただけで、
#. 手に金箔が付く模擬刀…<CLT>
msgctxt "0130 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The gold coating on this replica sword comes off at\n"
"the slightest touch.<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…気を付けないとな。<CLT>
msgctxt "0131 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "<CLT 4>I'd better be careful...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ベッド…
#. 特徴もない普通のものだ…寝心地も普通だし…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0132 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A bed. It looks pretty normal.\n"
"...Feels normal, too.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんて、ボクに言われたくないだろうな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0133 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I hope that didn't hurt the bed's feelings...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>特になんの仕掛けもない…
#. 普通のゴミ箱みたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0134 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Just an everyday trash can. I don't see any kind of\n"
"trapdoor or hidden compartments or anything...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>引き出しのある机だ。
#. よくある学生用って感じだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0135 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A desk with a few drawers. It's the kind of thing any\n"
"student would have.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いや、出ていっても仕方ない…
#. 舞園さんに話しかけよう。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0136 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>No, I can't just leave and ignore Sayaka...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …誰か来た？
msgctxt "0137 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...Is there someone here?"
msgstr ""
